    "northStar": "The Figure Plate",
    "overview": "The Explore page is Figure 1 of a paper: a flat white plate with lettered panels a-d, hairline rules, Hanken Grotesk only, and one red reserved for succeeded trials. Dark mode is a Dark slide with orange in red's place. Governs the Explore route only; other routes are not yet restyled.",
